From: SymonSaysLLC <gmcdonald@symoneural.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Sep 2026 08:20:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] mistralrs-quant: accept the 13.4 CUDA toolkit

The build script keeps an allowlist of toolkit versions and panics on any other.
This host builds with toolkit 13.4, which the kernels compile under unchanged
(sm_120a codegen verified from the produced objects). Add the version to the list.
cudarc has the same list with an environment override (CUDARC_CUDA_VERSION); this
crate has no override, hence the patch.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 mistralrs-quant/build.rs | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/mistralrs-quant/build.rs
+++ b/mistralrs-quant/build.rs
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@ const CUTLASS_COMMIT_ENV: &str = "MISTRALRS_CUTLASS_COMMIT";
 const CUDA_BUILD_ROOT_ENV: &str = "MISTRALRS_CUDA_BUILD_ROOT";
 #[cfg(feature = "cuda")]
 const SUPPORTED_CUDA_TOOLKIT_VERSIONS: &[(usize, usize)] = &[
+    (13, 4),
     (13, 3),
     (13, 2),
     (13, 1),
